{{also|Facio|fácio}}
==Latin==

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|la|dʰeh₁}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*fakiō}}, from {{inh|la|ine-pro|*dʰeh₁-||to put, place, set}}, possibly through a later intermediate root {{m|ine-pro|*dʰh₁-k-yé/ó-}}. Cognates include Ancient Greek {{m|grc|τίθημι}}, Sanskrit {{m|sa|दधाति|tr=dádhāti}}, Old English {{m|ang|dōn}} (English {{m|en|do}}) and Lithuanian {{m|lt|dėti||to put}}.

The passive voice is [[suppletive]]ly provided by the unrelated verb {{m|la|fīō||I become, I am made}}.

